    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/releases/tag/Instrumentation.ServiceFabricRemoting-1.16.0-beta.1"&gt;Instrumentation.ServiceFabricRemoting-1.16.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.ServiceFabricRemoting/1.16.0-beta.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.ServiceFabricRemoting v1.16.0-beta.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Raised the minimum required version of &lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ServiceFabric.Actors&lt;/code&gt; and&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;Microsoft.ServiceFabric.Services.Remoting&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;7.1.2448&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;8.4.268&lt;/code&gt;, as the&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;7.1&lt;/code&gt; Service Fabric runtime is going out of support.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4510" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4510/hovercard"&gt;#4510&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated OpenTelemetry core component version(s) to &lt;code&gt;1.16.0&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4487" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4487/hovercard"&gt;#4487&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Instrumentation.ServiceFabricRemoting-1.16.0-beta.1/src/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.ServiceFabricRemoting/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
